          "id": "0489356",
          "elType": "widget",
          "widgetType": "text-editor",
          "settings": {
            "editor": "<p style=\"font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.85; color: #4A5568; text-align: center;\">Plastic-Craft has been a trusted supplier of school materials for over 30 years.</p><p style=\"font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.85; color: #4A5568; text-align: center;\">From durable playground materials, to classroom dividers, all the way to school infrastructure &mdash; we specialize in providing durable, safe, and reliable plastic solutions to schools.</p>",
            "align": "center"
          },
          "elements": []
        }
      ],
